<title>UK: SBC sets $100 million four-year exchangeable bond.</title>
<headline>SBC sets $100 million four-year exchangeable bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SWISS BANK CORP</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	COUPON     1.75	MATURITY  **25.JUL.01</p>
<p> TYPE   EXCHANGEABLE  ISS PRICE  93	  PAY DATE    25.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.5	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA+/AA1   DENOMS (K) ONE	 YIELD	 3.66 PCT</p>
<p> NOTES	EXCHANGEABLE INTO NIKKEI 225 INDEX AT 23,464.3 YEN</p>
<p>		AT ANY TIME PREMIUM 18 PCT</p>
<p>	    **NON-CALL FOR TWO YEARS, THEREAFTER CALLABLE AT PAR</p>
<p>		PLUS ACCRUED INTEREST WITH SOFT PROTECTION AT 105</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
